  "body": "# Release v0.3.2\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/kopecmaciej/vi-mongo/blob/master/assets/logo/no-background.svg\" align=\"center\"/>\n\n## What's New\n\n### New Features\n\n- **Per-Connection Read-Only Mode** (by [@theduman](https://github.com/theduman), [#124](https://github.com/kopecmaciej/vi-mongo/pull/124)): New `readOnly` connection option blocks every write path: insert, update, delete, create/drop/rename collection, create/drop index, and aggregations containing `$out` or `$merge`. Toggle it from the checkbox in the connection form; read-only connections are marked with \"READ-ONLY\" in the header.\n- **Auth Source Option** ([#128](https://github.com/kopecmaciej/vi-mongo/issues/128)): New `authSource` connection option lets users defined in another database (e.g. `admin`) authenticate while connecting to a different target database.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- **Windows Log Path**: The log file now goes to the system temp directory instead of a hardcoded `/tmp`, so logging works on Windows.\n\n## Thank You\n\nThank you to everyone who contributed to and tested this release!\n\n"
}
